            "notes": "The first round is usually the one where I gauge what's going to happen for the rest of the match. Where I Identify threats, and the holes in my team.\n\nEvery first round starts with the following:\n\n[Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf),\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0),\n\n[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) / [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e).\n\n\nOnly use [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) if there's a soldier on the enemy team.\nI typically go for Armored Vest first for straight up damage reduction.",
