            "notes": "The power I pick depends HEAVY on what's happening in the round.\n\nIf we need straight up more healing -[Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4)\n\nIF my other support is heal focused - [Supply Surge](item_35d75d9e-66b7-426a-b92d-9dfd72ee5fbb)\n\nI always opt for my first purple here. [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) is best, I usually sell my weapon power items to afford this if we lost multiple rounds in a row.\n\n[Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) combined with [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) gives SO MUCH healing on a low health point target, I can not stress this enough. It'll take a critical tank from 45 to full in 2 seconds, and usually you can out heal Winton, Moira and Mei when using it.",
